#--- BUILD OUTPUT, NOT SOURCE.
#
# tools/ssr_package.sh rebuilds SSReplay-<build>.zip from the tree at any
# time, so committing one stores four megabytes to say what the tree
# already says. Forty-eight of them were tracked up to v79 and the habit
# was dropped when the packager landed; this is that decision written
# down, so the next build does not drift back into the repo.
SSReplay-v*.zip
